Z||000025||Formula 18||06-22-2001||02:41 PM||||ok so lockin the brakes might be a good idea if you just want to ditvch the car.... Locking the wheels will let the car slide in a straight line of the track on to the grass where you are no tlikely to be hit ny another car.  To SAVE it get back in the throttle and steer in to the skid. Don't try shifting it will be even worse. <P>Think tho, don't panic and slam the brakes... and don't drive on my streets.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Brian ||||reg||1
