Z||000041||FieroKyle||06-26-2001||10:10 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Pontiaddict:<BR><B>I think I know of the car you were talking about FieroKyle. Black 85gt auto with a smashed drivers side fender and a broken windshild. I looked at it when I was test driving the fastback.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>I was at Family Fare there in Lowell, and I come out and there what at first I thought my car. I did like a double take. My first thought was who smashed my car up until I looked at it closely. Then I was like whew! Since I haven't known anyone in lowell with a black/silver 85 GT. Well I am checking it out and looking at all the paint damaged and smashed fender, and the guy comes out and asks if I wanna buy it. I am like no I have one over there. Then he says he might look me up and  give to me as a parts car later on, and I was like yeah!. lol. He said he just moved to lowell so uh theres my story with that Fiero. He has been living in the area for about a month now and I see him driving around atleast once a week. His car runs great, just has a lot of body work to be done on it and interior is bad. I talk to him sometimes if I see him. <P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sign_1.jpg"> <BR>My Fast 'n Black Car<P>Kyle - 85' GT||||reg||12
